<title>UK: Britain's BTP to buy Alpha-Beta.</title>
<headline>Britain's BTP to buy Alpha-Beta.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British speciality chemicals group BTP Plc said on Monday it planned to buy Alpha-Beta Ltd in a deal that would make it a leading supplier of finings for the brewing industry.</p>
<p>The value of the net assets being acquired was 1.1 million stg, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The offer is conditional on there being not less than 90 percent acceptances.</p>
<p>Alpha-Beta's directors had given irrevocable  undertakings to accept the offer in respect to about 57.5 percent of the company's share capital, BTP said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
